sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Table
    participant L as RWLock
    participant RS as RowStore
    participant IM as IndexManager
    participant IX as HashIndex

    Note over T,IX: insert — write lock
    T->>L: acquire_write()
    T->>RS: append(row) → row_id
    T->>IM: on_insert(row_id, row)
    IM->>IX: insert_entry(row_id, row)
    T->>L: release_write()

    Note over T,IX: select with index — read lock
    T->>L: acquire_read()
    T->>IM: find_usable_index(predicate)
    IM-->>T: HashIndex on column
    T->>IX: lookup(predicate) → row_ids
    T->>RS: get(row_id) for each
    T->>L: release_read()

    Note over T,IX: create_index — write lock
    T->>L: acquire_write()
    T->>IM: create_index(def)
    IM->>IX: build from full scan of RowStore
    T->>L: release_write()
